-- and the consequence: molecular identity does not determine the identity of the solid. One pair of
-- polymorphs refutes it, so a record that names a substance by its molecule has not named the solid,
-- and the solubility, the dissolution rate and the shelf life belong to the solid.
polymorph-not-determined : PolymorphPair → (((A : Solid) → (B : Solid) → solid-mol A ≡ solid-mol B → A ≡ B) → Empty)
polymorph-not-determined p = λ det → snd (snd (snd p)) (cong solid-sg (det (fst p) (fst (snd p)) (fst (snd (snd p)))))
